{
  "_readme": [
    "Tanglish helper for the classifier. Edit freely, then retrain (python trainer.py) and redeploy.",
    "All words are lowercase. Repeated letters are ignored when matching, so 'panuga' also covers 'panugaaa', 'pannugaa', 'ppanuga'.",
    "spellings: every listed spelling is treated as the same word (the key).",
    "tags: a word in a tag list adds a meaning signal the model learns once for the whole group.",
    "sense_rules: if the message contains one of these words, that anchor is read in its normal meaning and skipped (e.g. pvt + company).",
    "self_words / request_words: next to an anchor, these mean it IS a DM ask, so the sense rule does not apply (add me, pvt vaa).",
    "REQUEST covers 'do it / send it / come / let's talk' words: in this group 'pm vaa' and 'pm pannunga' mean the same thing."
  ],
